, and type of residence. Study design. Population based study. Measures. We used national census data collected in 2011 ...\"\n  }\n]', Action 1: '<plan>\nTo solve this task, I need to find the gender split for individuals who have completed tertiary education according to the 2011 Bulgarian census. Specifically, I need the number of men and women who have completed tertiary education. After obtaining these figures, I will calculate the difference between the two numbers. Finally, I will express this difference in thousands of women, as requested in the task. \n\nThe first step is to search for the relevant data from the 2011 Bulgarian census. I'll use a Google search to find this information, as it may be available on official Bulgarian government or statistical websites.\n</plan>\n\n<action>\ntool: google_search\nparameters: {\"query\": \"2011 Bulgarian census tertiary education gender split\"}\n</action>']\n[Observation 2: 'Tool 'url_text_extractor' executed.\nResult: {\n  \"url\": \"https://www.nsi.bg/census2011/pdocs2/census2011final_en.pdf\",\n  \"extracted_text\": \"%PDF-1.5\\r%����\\r\\n2057 0 obj\\r<\\n>\\rendobj\\r         \\r\\n2083 0 obj\\r<\\n>/Filter/FlateDecode/ID[<187D8B2E1653054484C32AAACAE3E917><6E46C7D182689241A141B4109316B900>]/Index[2057 51]/Info 2056 0 R/Length 118/Prev 1186561/Root 2058 0 R/Size 2108/Type/XRef/W[1 3 1]>>stream\\r\\nh�bbd`\\u0010``b``U\\u0004�\\f� ��;�d�\\u0007�_�I\\u000309\\u0003L�C�az\\u000b&���k`R\\u001eD�F�H�\\u0006���A$�i��+\\u0010ɨ\\u0002��\\u0006��@d�4\\u0010)`\\u000f$\\u0019]���?����@W12p��\\u0005�\\r0���\\u0017�+�\\u0000\\u0003\\u0000K�\\u0015w\\r\\nendstream\\rendobj\\rstartxref\\r\\n0\\r\\n%%EOF\\r\\n\\n2107 0 obj\\r<\\n>stream\\r\\nh�b```\\u0002�i\\f�\\f\\f�k\\u0019�\\u0018\\u0010@\\b(��������A@��I�EE�E�\\u0001,���`Р���Ƞ���p�`�\\u000b�O�\\fƏ\\u0017\\u000e��'0�rؾ��\\u000b�(�kN�\\u0017��x|���Ѝ\\r{s\\u0014l8w5�9�O\\u0011�a�Ψ��Ȅ��yWÛF�\\u000fb�L�\\u000e,fP��Z���!���\\u000f�\\u001f��\\u0003�\\u0014�s�\\\\��\\u001d�\\u001