11.\n</memory>\n\n<reflection>\nThe last action involved searching Wikipedia for the gender statistics of tertiary education from the 2011 Bulgarian census. Unfortunately, this search did not provide the needed information about the number of men. While I have the number of women, the task goal remains incomplete without the male count. The action did not make progress toward resolving the task, indicating the need for a different strategy or source to find the complete data.\n</reflection>\n\n<plan>\nGiven the previous unsuccessful attempts to obtain the number of men, the next step will be to perform a Google search with a refined query to locate an official document or reliable source that might have the complete gender split data for tertiary education from the 2011 Bulgarian census. This search will focus on finding either an online database, summary report, or another document that could provide the needed information. The goal is to find the number of men, which is crucial for calculating the requested difference.\n</plan>\n\n<action>\ntool: google_search\nparameters: {\"query\": \"Bulgaria 2011 census tertiary education number of men\"}\n</action>']\n[Observation 7: 'Tool 'url_text_extractor' executed.\nResult: {\n  \"url\": \"https://www.nsi.bg/census2011/pdocs2/census2011final_en.pdf\",\n  \"extracted_text\": \"%PDF-1.5\\r%����\\r\\n2057 0 obj\\r<\\n>\\rendobj\\r         \\r\\n2083 0 obj\\r<\\n>/Filter/FlateDecode/ID[<187D8B2E1653054484C32AAACAE3E917><6E46C7D182689241A141B4109316B900>]/Index[2057 51]/Info 2056 0 R/Length 118/Prev 1186561/Root 2058 0 R/Size 2108/Type/XRef/W[1 3 1]>>stream\\r\\nh�bbd`\\u0010``b``U\\u0004�\\f� ��;�d�\\u0007�_�I\\u000309\\u0003L�C�az\\u000b&���k`R\\u001eD�F�H�\\u0006���A$�i��+\\u0010ɨ\\u0002��\\u0006��@d�4\\u0010)`\\u000f$\\u0019]���?����@W12p��\\u0005�\\r0���\\u0017�+�\\u0000\\u0003\\u0000K�\\u0015w\\r\\nendstream\\rendobj\\rstartxref\\r\\n0\\r\\n%%EOF\\r\\n\\n2107 0 obj\\r<\\n>stream\\r\\nh�b```\\u0002�i\\f�\\f\\f�k\\u0019�\